# Scoped re-inclusion for this result set only. The repository-wide .gitignore excludes
# `*.jpg` (line 69) and `data/` (line 55); the fixed-order review grids and the measured
# per-case scores are primary evidence for this pilot and must be published. The directory
# is named `measured/` rather than `data/` because an excluded directory is not descended
# into, so a nested negation cannot re-include it.
!*.jpg
!measured/
